ET:"Shy Guy talk";MG:"And while i'm at it\, did you know that you are in a world where everyones dreams come together in one place! That's how I was made! But be careful! Some people dream of nasty things!";TE:"Shy Guy talk 2";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
